<title>MEXICO: SOCCER-MEXICO BEAT JAMAICA 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MEXICO BEAT JAMAICA 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico beat Jamaica 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a CONCACAF semifinal stage group three World</p>
<p>Cup qualifying match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Mexico - Zague (41st minute), Carlos Hermosillo (53rd)</p>
<p>Jamaica - Walter Boyd (79th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 100,000</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> Jamaica	3  2  0  1  6  3  6</p>
<p> Mexico	 3  2  0  1  6  3  6</p>
<p> Honduras     3  2  0  1  6  5  6</p>
<p> St.Vincent   3  0  0  3  2  9  0</p>
<p>Next match: Oct 27 - Honduras v Jamaica.</p>
<p>Note: top two qualify for the final CONCACAF qualifying</p>
<p>round.</p>
</text>
